["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Democratizing Security for the Agentic Web with Cloudflare CTO Dane Knecht CVE WebPKI Zero Trust AEO X402 CPM/CTM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-nopriors-cdn巨头cto预言-未来18个月一半工程时间要用来补漏洞/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/44db1fd0a7b5258a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">41:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>CDN巨頭CTO預言：未來18個月一半工程時間要用來補漏洞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">漏洞披露速度從一年一次變成每週多次，連TLS信任根密鑰都曾被人用種子數字4破解——CTO說未來18個月，一半工程資源要砸向安全。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Netflix Angst, The End of the Internet, Q&amp;A on Meta’s VR Glasses, Anthropic Alignment, You Can See Everything elliptical curve cryptography zero trust generative UI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-sharptech-广告模式能无限涨价不流失用户-订阅模式做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>廣告模式能無限漲價不流失用戶，訂閱模式做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">廣告定價能隨算法變準持續上漲、不影響用戶留存；訂閱漲價一旦引發流失就晚了——這正是奈飛參與度下滑、廣告營收目標又沒達標時真正該慌的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">奈飛</span><span class=\"tag\">廣告變現</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Forgotten Godmother of Economic Literature Edgeworth box marginalists labor theory of value DSGE racked rent\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-oddlots-比简-奥斯汀还畅销的她-因在小说里说教太重被经济学史遗忘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">43:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>比簡·奧斯汀還暢銷的她，因在小說裡說教太重被經濟學史遺忘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的小說比《國富論》原著好讀得多，卻因為教育意味太濃，在簡·奧斯汀式自然主義敘事興起後被讀者和經濟學史一起拋棄。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">經濟思想史</span><span class=\"tag\">女性經濟學家</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"反地產邏輯，為什麼成就了阿那亞｜欽文對話馬寅\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-阿那亚的成功靠的是没有退路-不是战略远见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f06d53df338a0f19-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">28:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王欽文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>阿那亞的成功靠的是沒有退路，不是戰略遠見</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬寅說如果2012年還能像別的開發商一樣快進快出賺快錢，他絕不會死磕阿那亞——是十億貸款和只剩這一個項目的絕境，逼出了這套反地產邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">長期主義</span><span class=\"tag\">社區運營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"重新定義個人電腦，老黃到底憑什麼？RTX Spark深度解析 PRISM MXC Windows on ARM PAIR Prefill/Decode MOE\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-laoshi-rtx-spark芯片没变-英伟达要的不是性能而是pc定义权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">老</div><span class=\"dur\">24:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>RTX Spark芯片沒變，英偉達要的不是性能而是PC定義權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這顆芯片幾乎就是去年發布的DGX Spark換了操作系統，老黃真正想要的不是跑分贏家，而是把CPU、GPU、內存、系統捆成一套只認英偉達規則的PC新架構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">CUDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Compute Comes in Rectangles — Erik Bernhardsson, Modal CEO BYOC Neoclouds spot capacity FDE MFU\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-latentspace-gpu-稀缺的真正病根-算力只能整块按三年期打包购买/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7cf8550aeeab084a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>GPU 稀缺的真正病根：算力只能整塊按三年期打包購買</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說，GPU 短缺最大的問題不是搶不到卡，而是幾乎所有產能都打包成三到六個月後交付的三年期合約出售，這和大多數客戶真實的忽高忽低的需求完全對不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力採購</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU稀缺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Here’s Why Experts Keep Being Wrong About the Future radical uncertainty hindsight bias\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-goodfight-预测失败不是数据问题-是未来本身不可知/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>預測失敗不是數據問題，是未來本身不可知</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">手握數據、模型和算力的專家照樣在2008年集體失算，因為未來不是等信息補全的拼圖，而是一張還沒畫出來的空白畫布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">不確定性</span><span class=\"tag\">預測失誤</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Frontier Ideas a16z Wants to Fund | Marc Andreessen, Ben Horowitz &amp; Chris Dixon reward hacking outer planets the covenant swarm\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-a16z-创业时代变了-该问的不是太疯狂-而是够不够疯狂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/89623e03df420598-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>創業時代變了：該問的不是太瘋狂，而是夠不夠瘋狂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">早期用AI的人和普通機構之間的認知差距，是Marc Andreessen職業生涯裡見過最大的一次，而且還在變寬——這意味著中規中矩的產品方案註定不會有差異化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">a16z</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Stand Out In A World Of AI Designs MCP vibe coding / vibe-coded decacorn\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-ycsp-百亿美元公司从不做滚动劫持-ai建的站却总爱这么做/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/994d5c99c317053d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">47:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>百億美元公司從不做滾動劫持，AI建的站卻總愛這麼做</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">滾動劫持打斷用戶已經熟悉的滾動節奏，精度一錯位就惹人煩；百億美元公司官網從不這麼幹，這反而成了識別AI隨手建站的信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI設計工具</span><span class=\"tag\">創業網站</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What will computer chips look like in 2045? EUV High-NA EUV Gate-all-around (GAA) CFET Backside power Hybrid bonding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-dwarkesh-就算无限砸钱-先进芯片产能也只能翻倍-不是十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21bf8bafac799fac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>就算無限砸錢，先進芯片產能也只能翻倍，不是十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英特爾CTO說，哪怕拿出無限資本開支，現有全球芯片製造設備存量也只能讓先進製程晶圓產能翻一倍——而AI算力需求過去十年每年增長三倍，缺口只會越拉越大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體制造</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片產能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Recommendation Engine for Commodity Traders — Anekha Sokhal, Moshi RecSys MORSE Fulbright Scholarship ICLR Vision Language Model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-latentspace-这家创业公司说自己不是新彭博-而是交易员的推荐系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5deeb7411e2beff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">26:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>這家創業公司說自己不是新彭博，而是交易員的推薦系統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人把公司定位為彭博、Claude和Netflix的結合體：價值不在給交易員更多數據，而在於像Netflix一樣主動推送他們自己想不到該看的二階關聯信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span><span class=\"tag\">大宗商品交易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Apex Predator: CrowdStrike CEO George Kurtz on Adversaries Armed With AI Agents pyramid of pain breakout time ablated models digital twin distillation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-nopriors-ai抹平攻击门槛-脚本小子也能用上国家级黑客的本事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad8f4d231b5e5ea8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">45:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>AI抹平攻擊門檻：腳本小子也能用上國家級黑客的本事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開源大模型裝在家用電腦上就能造勒索軟件，入侵後平均29分鐘、最快27秒就能在系統裡橫向移動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Leveraged ETFs Really Work (Marco Sammon &amp; Chris Murray) | #432 convexity bonus volatility drag break-even return swap expected log wealth\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-rationalreminder-3倍杠杆etf跑赢正股-标的股票得先涨170/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>3倍槓桿ETF跑贏正股，標的股票得先漲170%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">槓桿ETF每天只盯日收益、不盯年化倍數：日波動5%的標的，3倍產品要漲170%才能反超正股本身——門檻隨波動率指數級跳升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">槓桿ETF</span><span class=\"tag\">波動率損耗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bhaskar Sunkara Thinks the Market Has a Place Under Socialism market socialism soft budget constraint benchmark wage DSA Rawlsian liberalism labor-managed firm\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-oddlots-激进版社会主义-土地全部公有-但房租仍由市场决定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>激進版社會主義：土地全部公有，但房租仍由市場決定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他主張，社會主義不必靠配給：把土地和住房全部收歸公有後，仍可以保留按市場定價的租金和搬遷自由，用價格而不是配給來分配空間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">市場社會主義</span><span class=\"tag\">工人所有制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The dramatic race to discover Insulin Ebers papyrus ligate islets intersecretion theory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-throughline-胰岛素救命的秘方-源自一个失败医生失眠夜写下的25个词/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4970x4970+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ffd%2F78%2Fc52487db40188bbe5c7b3c988848%2F9d3ebf18-8ca2-4f49-b2a8-c589b344ae0c.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">37:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>胰島素救命的秘方，源自一個失敗醫生失眠夜寫下的25個詞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">班廷本是四個月等不到一個病人的失敗醫生，一次失眠把講義和論文拼成25個詞，又瞞著同事搶先在垂死男孩身上做人體實驗，才在倫理真空裡搶出了胰島素。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span><span class=\"tag\">胰島素</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The charity that is also a time machine donor-advised fund (DAF) Schedule B chimera\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-complexsys-美国的捐赠基金其实是个时间机器-减税现在拿-捐钱以后再说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b98a243f0a884fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">27:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>美國的捐贈基金其實是個時間機器：減稅現在拿，捐錢以後再說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這是一套合法的「慈善時間機器」：把錢存進去立刻減稅，捐給誰、何時捐可以往後拖很多年——Anthropic員工未來的鉅額捐款很可能就走這條路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">慈善</span><span class=\"tag\">稅務</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Origins of Constantinople Tetrarchy Solidus Milion Notitia Hippodrome\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-ancients-罗马城早被废弃-君士坦丁堡只是把迁都做到了极致/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83ea79d083d093bd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬城早被廢棄，君士坦丁堡只是把遷都做到了極致</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴克裡先以來，米蘭、尼科米底亞、特里爾早已分走羅馬的權力和宮廷；君士坦丁只是把這套遷都慣例做大、做永久，並冠上自己的名字。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拜占庭帝國</span><span class=\"tag\">羅馬帝國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Myths vs Reality of Mummification natron mummia Fayum portraits unrolling party\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-historyhit-木乃伊制作不是为了保存遗体-而是要把死者变成神/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb07692a6c393b9b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>木乃伊製作不是為了保存遺體，而是要把死者變成神</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">策展人坎貝爾·普萊斯說，裹屍、塗樹脂、畫金邊這些工序，目標是把屍體改造成神像，而非留住死者生前的容貌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">木乃伊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"從2億到40億，接班人如何重塑潔麗雅？｜欽文對話石晶 特勞特理論\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-wangqinwen-洁丽雅接班人放弃百亿目标-规模做到又能怎么样/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">王</div><span class=\"dur\">36:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王欽文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>潔麗雅接班人放棄百億目標：規模做到又能怎麼樣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三年前他喊出三年破百億的目標，如今卻說規模做到頭也沒意義，他要的是一個能活一百年、持續健康增長的品牌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家族企業</span><span class=\"tag\">二代接班</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Arvind Krishna &amp; Nikesh Arora: Quantum Threat, Open vs Frontier AI, AI Cyber Warfare &amp; SaaS Collapse QBI (Quantum Benchmarking Initiative) logical qubit post-quantum cryptography ZDR (zero data retention) open weight model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-allin-加密硬盘现在被偷-五年后也可能被量子计算机破解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2252b98cbb7fdf85-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>加密硬盤現在被偷，五年後也可能被量子計算機破解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">IBM和Palo Alto Networks的CEO說，量子計算機預計2030年前後就能破解今天的加密算法，而後量子密碼學方案早已現成，只是企業一直懶得換。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子計算</span><span class=\"tag\">密碼學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"716. King Arthur: The Truth Behind the Legend (Part 4) Historia Britonum dux bellorum Annales Cambriae Mirabilia Britanniae Y Gododdin cataphract\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-restishistory-亚瑟之名只流行于六七世纪-这是他存在的最强证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/72c546eadef77e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>亞瑟之名只流行於六七世紀，這是他存在的最強證據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現存證據沒有一條能單獨證明亞瑟真實存在，但「亞瑟」作為羅馬人名只在不列顛貴族間流行過六七世紀這一小段時間，這個空窗至今無人能解釋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀史</span><span class=\"tag\">史源考據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"406. Norman Conquest: The First Crusade (Part 6) Varangian Guard Gesta Francorum liege man\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-empirehist-拜占庭皇帝求援换来十字军-却也换来博希蒙德的个人造神运动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>拜占庭皇帝求援換來十字軍，卻也換來博希蒙德的個人造神運動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿萊克修斯向西方求援引發了第一次十字軍東征，但真正借勢上位的是假死脫身、靠暢銷書包裝自己的諾曼人博希蒙德，拜占庭的名譽卻成了這場交易的代價。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">十字軍東征</span><span class=\"tag\">拜占庭帝國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Can Dividend Investing Give You Yield AND Growth? yield trap free cash flow payout ratio net share issuance\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-mastersinbiz-股息不是收益率游戏-是识别哪家公司真能把现金还给你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5dd15b785a2d85d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>股息不是收益率遊戲，是識別哪家公司真能把現金還給你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">股息是現金，騙不了人；作者用自己在金融危機前以51美元賣出花旗的真實交易，說明高股息率常常是價格暴跌的假象，而非公司變好的信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">股息投資</span><span class=\"tag\">價值投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cure to Founder Burnout Isn&#x27;t Rest | 6 Solo Founders swallow the frog chief of staff\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-solofounders-创始人倦怠的解药不是休息-而是重新找到动力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/18d01623f9e39d48-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>創始人倦怠的解藥不是休息，而是重新找到動力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在Lindy熬了兩年多後，Flo以為自己需要半年假期才能恢復，但真正讓他走出倦怠的，是重新找到動力的那一刻，精力幾乎立刻就回來了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創始人倦怠</span><span class=\"tag\">獨自創業</span>\n</div></div></a>"]